# Keep secrets out of the Docker build context.
# The registry image builds from the repo root, so any committed-or-local
# .env in the tree (e.g. packages/registry/.env) would otherwise be copied
# into the build context via `COPY packages/registry/ ...`.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Not needed in the build context (deps are installed in-image; history is irrelevant).
.git
**/node_modules

# Local tooling / scratch that should never ship in an image.
.claude
